    "rules": [
      "Do not convert a reconstructed intention into a falsely claimed pre-work baseline.",
      "Do not infer project, system, application, or resource placement without recording the basis.",
      "Startup establishes orientation and routing; session-specific context is resolved from workflow requirements.",
      "Resource locations should resolve through the Resource Registry when registered.",
      "Current, historical, planned, and reconstructed truth remain distinguishable.",
      "Material discoveries and scope changes are preserved as chronology, amendments, or exceptions.",
      "Every claimed completed workflow step has supporting evidence or an explicit human decision.",
      "The supervisor view is retained even when no actual supervisor participates.",
      "Routine workflow execution does not recursively create another run unless the workflow, schema, authority rules, or capabilities changed materially."
